  "prefLabel": "Puc 2103.03 Conduct of Distribution System Operations and Access to System Control Operations by Competitive Affiliates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2103.03 Conduct of Distribution System Operations and Access to System Control Operations by Competitive Affiliates. A utility shall not allow an employee, officer, director, or agent of a competitive affiliate to:\n\n(a) Conduct distribution system operations; or\n\n(b) Have access to system control centers or similar facilities used by distribution operations in any way that differs from the access available to employees of non-affiliated competitors.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15 (from Puc 2103.04); ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2100.html"
